            {
                "entry_id": "1f3ef26d-8f8e-3eee-9d58-692b459abac0",
                "word": "Rhodanian",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2e227389-d26b-32b9-b6a8-c697072fb490",
                        "entry_id": "1f3ef26d-8f8e-3eee-9d58-692b459abac0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of, or aboriginal to, the Rhône valley."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a99781cd-3d81-4841-93c7-81ed97e41344",
                                "sense_id": "2e227389-d26b-32b9-b6a8-c697072fb490",
                                "text": "As an article in Paris match put it, Donzère-Mondragon [Dam] enabled the \"return to old sources [of energy] in order to forge the future,\" and other journalists emphasized that the CNR's [Compagnie Nationale du Rhône's] \"development plan\" would \"safeguard Rhodanian partimony\" for \"future generations\" and continue to allow traditional activities such as fishing."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "93da7f11-a6d4-499d-b5b7-0e01bb28e519",
                                "sense_id": "2e227389-d26b-32b9-b6a8-c697072fb490",
                                "text": "Some fishers opposed Brégnier-Cordon because it would destroy several lônes, a specifically Rhodanian term for the small, temporary islands created by the river’s meanders that created especially rich fish habitat."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "524b8943-324d-4d2c-8280-9b4bc8bd5c63",
                        "source_entry_id": "1f3ef26d-8f8e-3eee-9d58-692b459abac0",
                        "source_sense_id": "2e227389-d26b-32b9-b6a8-c697072fb490",
                        "source_sense_description": "of or aboriginal to the Rhône valley",
                        "target_lang_word": "rhodanien",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "rhodanien",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "51543380-03a3-3f11-a5fa-fb7b42038ae9",
                                        "entry_id": "ccac094c-21e5-3cdb-9a72-8f47d1146443",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relatif au Rhône ou à sa vallée."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2787f3f9-128c-4f2d-8dd5-01b761aea7a5",
                                                "sense_id": "51543380-03a3-3f11-a5fa-fb7b42038ae9",
                                                "text": "Le bassin, le sillon rhodanien."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b59bb6a0-2b1f-3d3a-931e-f38924ea620a",
                                        "entry_id": "ccac094c-21e5-3cdb-9a72-8f47d1146443",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relatif au département du Rhône, à la région Rhône-Alpes, à la région autour du Rhône."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e636de27-9c3a-4997-a500-092d01fa4ac1",
                                                "sense_id": "b59bb6a0-2b1f-3d3a-931e-f38924ea620a",
                                                "text": "Les concours agricoles montrent que les éleveurs charolais, limousins ou normands, que les arboriculteurs rhodaniens ou roussillonnais sont à la tête du progrès et le renom de nos crus de vins démontre que nous avons des vignerons qui savent travailler."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1b04d37-5d91-4669-9406-7fc3da9b4911",
                                                "sense_id": "b59bb6a0-2b1f-3d3a-931e-f38924ea620a",
                                                "text": "Le club rhodanien, 7ᵉ l’an dernier et donc sans compétition européenne, voit sa marge de manœuvre réduite pour son recrutement, mais pourra tout de même recruter, surtout après s’être délesté de ses gros salaires, comme Aouar, Dembélé ou Boateng."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9397a16c-5e2a-457a-bc02-b8074680fd66",
                                                "sense_id": "b59bb6a0-2b1f-3d3a-931e-f38924ea620a",
                                                "text": "Auvergne-Rhône-Alpes reprend pour sa part la gestion de 756 km de routes nationales non concédées en Auvergne et dans le couloir rhodanien."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
